# ==============================================================================
# SyncDesk - Frontend Production Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# Target Platform: Vercel
# Location: frontend/.env.production
#
# INSTRUCTIONS FOR VERCEL DASHBOARD:
# 1. Open your Vercel Dashboard -> Select your 'SyncDesk' project.
# 2. Navigate to: Settings -> Environment Variables.
# 3. You can either:
#    - Copy and paste the entire block below into the "Key" box (Vercel will
#      automatically parse the key and value pairs), OR
#    - Manually enter the Key: VITE_API_URL and Value: (your Render URL).
# 4. Check all environments: Production, Preview, Development.
# 5. Click Save, then Redeploy your latest deployment without cache.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Backend REST API Base URL
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Description: Public HTTPS URL of the deployed Render FastAPI backend.
# The frontend API client automatically appends '/api/v1' if omitted, but providing
# the full URL ensures strict predictability.
#
# REPLACE: Replace 'syncdesk-backend' with your actual Render service name.
# Example: https://syncdesk-backend.onrender.com/api/v1
VITE_API_URL=https://<YOUR-RENDER-SERVICE-NAME>.onrender.com/api/v1

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECURITY NOTICE:
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER put database connection strings (DATABASE_URL) or JWT secrets (SECRET_KEY)
# in this frontend file. Any variable in a Vite frontend is compiled into public
# client-side JavaScript accessible to all visitors.
# Backend secrets must only be configured in the Render Web Service Dashboard.
# ==============================================================================
